71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1iCUN33cPwoQ7kNvwEgynKQ&_nc_oc=AdoWqizvGXewYXMq9JVPKf3qIai6ByuiO8pv6MoBjhnMc8TW9Nue_S4jlHdu_-brl14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMjd-D9K_UwNIp-Us9eR7mfFeNVUpuQgL2U8DOn-wyOMA&oe=6AC0FEB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qbgnL-hJVMcQ7kNvwHfojH3&_nc_oc=AdohDVQ9zguWzluU6ZGZDePWmvx13GdMxLR5Qa9nE3ZXaUpp_b600UnbUENXTmM09JM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMezDahBjRQ2ucwqZWsr6BxXDBPASOfXlaDp5aIsVOV0g&oe=6AC11193"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lST2C0XVqgIQ7kNvwFQkzg6&_nc_oc=AdpvEhB9hpvapP84zAxFnkQJBSjOrgf7Bw7y5N5as3MnVH4jbvv4w9Q63STrIgJsCY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOM4Tqk-Tl0Rs_ox-rAL1T0iL77WOf31Y9YE_8bXb4oYQ&oe=6AC10FDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: